The cards in this folder are derived from timing data published by OpenF1
(https://openf1.org), with round numbers and event names from Jolpica-F1
(https://github.com/jolpica/jolpica-f1).

They are released under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike
4.0 International licence (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0), as OpenF1's licence requires, and not
under the Apache License 2.0 that covers the code of this repository.

The timing data belongs to the Formula 1 companies. BoxBox is an unofficial,
non-commercial student project with no link to them.
